# The fixture module's routes (tests/fixtures/module), which the api mounts in its tests only:
# tests/openapi.test.ts runs this file against its api with the dev environment of api-calls/.

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/fixture: the tenant the handler runs in
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/fixture
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/fixture: counts the items of a valid body
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/fixture
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{ "name": "example", "items": [{ "qty": 2 }, { "qty": 3 }] }

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/fixture/{name}: greets a fixture by its name
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/fixture/example?greeting=hi
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
